We should not place Agent.exe directly in dist manually because dist is regenerated on every build.

Fix the build process as follows:

1. Generate Agent.exe using PyInstaller before frontend build

2. Copy the generated Agent.exe into:
   frontend/public/PerfSonicAgent.exe

3. Ensure npm build process copies it into dist automatically

4. Verify:

   * dist/PerfSonicAgent.exe exists after build
   * Direct URL /PerfSonicAgent.exe downloads the binary correctly

Do NOT place files manually in dist.
Use public folder as source of truth.
